-- Ultimate Football Hub 2026
-- Lag-Optimized Anti-Bounce + Sticky Head + Dive Boost + Auto Rush + Swat +
-- Jump Boost + Stealth Fly + Walkspeed Lock 21+ + Noclip + Semi/Invisible Heads
--
-- UI: self-contained mini-Rayfield fallback. Does not require HTTP or
-- loadstring. If sirius.menu loads, we use it. Otherwise the built-in UI
-- runs, which uses only Instance.new and cannot fail to load.
--
-- Ragdoll Lock: kills our own movement drivers while ragdolled, but leaves
--               the physics assembly alone so gravity actually pulls you
--               down through a tackle and you don't clip through the floor.
-- Auto Rush Gate: sticky head + head proxy disabled while auto rush is running.
-- Carrier Head Block: cannot stick to / stand on a head whose owner has the ball.
-- Self-Carry Block: cannot stick to / stand on anyone's head while YOU have the ball.
-- Rush Cut-Off: true intercept on his forward ray, then aim PAST the meeting
--               point so we arrive ahead of him, not on his tail. No side
--               bias, no chase-from-behind. Body ends up in his path.
-- Sticky Range: stick onto a head from up to 3 studs past the edge.
-- Sticky Break: once stuck, if we're no longer physically above the head
--               (knocked off, displaced, drifted), drop the stick. No
--               magnet-lock to a head we aren't standing on.
-- Mid-Possession Toggle: pressing R while someone already holds the ball seeds
--               the carrier + engage timer same-tick.
-- Auto Rush Arm-Only: the UI toggle only arms. It does NOT auto-engage when a
--               carrier is spotted. Press R to actually start rushing.

